/-!
# A352103

a(n) is the maximal (or lazy) tribonacci representation of n using a binary system of vectors not containing three consecutive 0's.

The 40 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A352103

